    "snapCallback (prototype method) — maps to the contract webhook + simulator": {
      "note": "The prototype's API.snapCallback(bookingId, outcome) is NOT a FE-called real endpoint. In production SNAP calls the signed provider webhook (POST /api/v1/webhooks/midtrans) and the FE only reads GET /payments/{id}/status. The mock SNAP page (snap.html equivalent) simulates the outcome then the FE re-verifies: outcome='success' -> PAID/SUCCEEDED, 'failed' -> PENDING_PAYMENT/FAILED, deadline passed -> EXPIRED/EXPIRED. Return shape mirrors PaymentStatus."
    },
    "SNAP simulator scenarios (local-simulator, drives status transitions)": {
      "note": "POST /api/v1/local-simulator/payments/{attemptId}/scenario — the mock SNAP page (snap.html equivalent) calls this. scenario enum: SETTLE -> PAID, SETTLE_LATE -> VERIFYING then PAID, EXPIRE -> EXPIRED, DENY -> FAILED, TIMEOUT -> UNKNOWN/REVIEW, DUPLICATE_WEBHOOK/OUT_OF_ORDER -> idempotent (status unchanged).",
      "returns": "202 Accepted"
    }
  }
}
